BUILD combining both amendments. The draft's face-card dimming is dropped by both lenses.
(1) Asleep look. A Clarity.every(100,'G15') tick sets three classes on #app, each after a 400 ms hold, and clears them at once:
- cm-strip while G.busy;
- cm-mood while G.sceneOn || (G.busy && marina.state !== 'tantrum');
- cm-alert while G.busy && G.sceneOn.
The CSS dims child buttons only, so the container rules keep winning: #app.cm-strip #roombar .rb, #app.cm-strip #floorpill .fl, #app.cm-mood #moodbar .mood:not(.cm-awake), #app.cm-alert #alerts .alertb, #app.cm-alert #reqBtn {opacity:.45;filter:grayscale(.7);transition:opacity .2s}.
(2) Moods (child). All five dim, except one: if a live mood tap is followed within 500 ms by G.sceneOn turning true, record it at tap time and give that face .cm-awake until the scene ends. Never key anything on .cur; the .cur outline stays, dimmed. Face cards are never dimmed (both lenses).
(3) 'Not now'. Clarity.pointer('up','G15') decides at tap time from each control's LIVE rule, never from the class:
- .rb and .fl are dead while G.busy;
- .mood is dead while G.sceneOn || (G.busy && marina.state !== 'tantrum');
- .alertb and #reqBtn are dead while G.busy && G.sceneOn;
- .facecard is dead when nav.js:101's test fails (G.busy, !quiet(), or the person is missing or hidden).
A dead tap gets Clarity.shake(el) (translate only, composite add) and Audio2.blip(-12,'triangle',0.08,0.1). Face cards get no blip while #storyBox exists. Marina's own card (data-who=marina) gets a small wiggle and a soft blip.
(4) Mood blip. After a dead .mood tap, for 60 ms, Clarity.hook('Audio2.blip','G15',{order:10,before}) skips exactly one call whose arguments are exactly (12,'square',0.08). The 'not now' blip itself is never skipped.
(5) Scene taps. Clarity.hook('onTap','G15',{order:10,before}) acts only while G.sceneOn: it adds a 36 px grey ring at the finger in #fx, with inline style pointer-events:none, for 400 ms, plus the low blip. It never skips.
(6) Nothing happens in bathTime or other busy states that are not scenes. If the strip's nope blip piles onto the bath sound, skip it while G.busy && !G.sceneOn && marina.state === 'cheer'.
(7) Never stopPropagation or preventDefault. The map is never dimmed.
