(4) No look-only peek. 📒 is never shown while it has .off. If 📒 is visible and tappable when the toast lands, it gets one Clarity.shake wiggle; otherwise a short sparkle (fixed layer, pointer-events:none) marks its home spot.
(5) Treasures. Clarity.hook('UI.bigIcon','G27',{order:10,before}) defers glyphs ending in '✨' while an .act exists, until Clarity.hook('UI.closeActions','G27',{order:20,after}) or 1.5 s. If a screen is open by then, wait for screenClose. Replay with Clarity.inner('UI.bigIcon'), exactly once, never dropped.
(6) Unchanged and at the same moments: award(), saves, the jingle, the stars, m_sticker and m_found.
